{"seq":1,"slug":"typeclasses","title":"类型类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/typeclasses","wordCount":1186,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型类\">类型类</h1><p>面向对象用接口和继承实现「同一个调用，不同类型给不同行为」。Haskell 没有继承，它用类型类（type class）干这件事，而且干得更干净：行为与数据分离，实例可后补，约束写进类型签名一目了然。类型类是 Haskell 复用机制的核心，也是后面 Functor、Monad 这些抽象赖以定义的语法基础——它们本身全是类型类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个类型类声明「一组类型需要支持哪些操作」。<code>Eq</code> 类要求一个 <code>==</code>；<code>Show</code> 类要求一个 <code>show</code>。某个具体类型通过写 instance「认领」这个类，给出操作的实现。函数则用 <code>=&gt;</code> 约束语法声明「我只接受属于某类的类型」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[class 声明&lt;br/&gt;需要哪些操作] --&gt; B[方法签名&lt;br/&gt;== show compare]&#10;  C[instance 声明&lt;br/&gt;某类型的实现] --&gt; D[类型字典&lt;br/&gt;编译期解析]&#10;  A --&gt; E[约束 =&gt;&lt;br/&gt;函数签名里限定]&#10;  E --&gt; F[调用点解析实例]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[静态分派&lt;br/&gt;编译期确定]&#10;  A --&gt; H[默认方法&lt;br/&gt;最小完整定义]&#10;  C --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[class 声明&lt;br/&gt;需要哪些操作] --&gt; B[方法签名&lt;br/&gt;== show compare]\n  C[instance 声明&lt;br/&gt;某类型的实现] --&gt; D[类型字典&lt;br/&gt;编译期解析]\n  A --&gt; E[约束 =&gt;&lt;br/&gt;函数签名里限定]\n  E --&gt; F[调用点解析实例]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[静态分派&lt;br/&gt;编译期确定]\n  A --&gt; H[默认方法&lt;br/&gt;最小完整定义]\n  C --&gt; H</pre><p>类型类与 OOP 接口最大的不同：实例是「事后」可以为任意类型（甚至别人写的类型）补充的，无需修改原类型定义；分派在编译期完成（通过传递隐式的方法字典），没有运行时虚表开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>OOP 接口</th>\n<th>Haskell 类型类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为与数据</td>\n<td>绑在一起（方法在类内）</td>\n<td>分离（instance 独立声明）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否事后扩展已有类型</td>\n<td>通常不能</td>\n<td>能（孤儿实例需谨慎）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分派时机</td>\n<td>运行时虚表</td>\n<td>编译期字典传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多参数支持</td>\n<td>单接收者</td>\n<td>多参数类型类（扩展）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束表达</td>\n<td>通过类型层次</td>\n<td>签名里 <code>=&gt;</code> 显式列出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声明一个类型类\">声明一个类型类</h2><p>类型类的定义直白：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Describable a where&#10;  describe :: a -&gt; String&#10;  describe _ = &quot;无可奉告&quot;     -- 默认实现，实例可不覆盖&#10;&#10;data Animal = Cat | Dog&#10;&#10;instance Describable Animal where&#10;  describe Cat = &quot;一只猫&quot;&#10;  describe Dog = &quot;一只狗&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Describable a where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  describe :: a -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  describe _ = \"无可奉告\"     -- 默认实现，实例可不覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Animal = Cat | Dog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instance Describable Animal where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  describe Cat = \"一只猫\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  describe Dog = \"一只狗\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>class</code> 列出方法签名（可带默认实现），<code>instance</code> 为具体类型填上实现。许多标准类规定了「最小完整定义」——比如 <code>Eq</code> 只要你实现 <code>==</code> 或 <code>/=</code> 之一，另一个由默认实现自动补全。这种默认方法机制大幅减少样板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束与字典传递\">约束与字典传递</h2><p>当一个函数需要对未知类型做某种操作时，就用 <code>=&gt;</code> 加约束。<code>elem :: Eq a =&gt; a -&gt; [a] -&gt; Bool</code> 说「只要 <code>a</code> 能判等，我就能判断它在不在列表里」。</p>\n<p>约束在底层是怎么实现的？GHC 把每个约束编译成一个「字典」——一张装着该类型所有方法实现的记录表，在调用时隐式传入。<code>Eq a =&gt;</code> 实际上变成多传一个 <code>Eq</code> 字典参数。理解这点能解释两件事：为什么类型类约束有微小运行时成本（传字典），以及为什么实例必须在编译期可解析。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/types-basics\">类型基础</a> 里讲的参数多态不同——那里函数对类型一无所知，这里函数能对类型「做事」，代价是带上字典。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常用标准类型类\">常用标准类型类</h2><p>Haskell 标准库的类型类构成一张网，几个最常打交道的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Eq a where (==) :: a -&gt; a -&gt; Bool&#10;class Eq a =&gt; Ord a where compare :: a -&gt; a -&gt; Ordering   -- 注意超类约束&#10;class Show a where show :: a -&gt; String&#10;class Semigroup a where (&lt;&gt;) :: a -&gt; a -&gt; a               -- 可结合的合并&#10;class Semigroup a =&gt; Monoid a where mempty :: a           -- 带单位元\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Eq a where (==) :: a -> a -> Bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Eq a => Ord a where compare :: a -> a -> Ordering   -- 注意超类约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Show a where show :: a -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Semigroup a where (&#x3C;>) :: a -> a -> a               -- 可结合的合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Semigroup a => Monoid a where mempty :: a           -- 带单位元</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>Ord</code> 写成 <code>Eq a =&gt; Ord a</code>——这是超类约束：一个类型要可排序，前提是它先可判等。<code>Monoid</code> 也是个绝佳例子：它抽象出「能合并、且有单位元」这个代数结构，数学上要求满足结合律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋄</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a \\diamond b) \\diamond c = a \\diamond (b \\diamond c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与单位元律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e \\diamond a = a = a \\diamond e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。列表、字符串、求和都是 Monoid。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动派生-deriving\">自动派生：deriving</h2><p>为每个类型手写 <code>Eq</code>、<code>Show</code> 实例很枯燥，GHC 允许自动派生：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Color = Red | Green | Blue&#10;  deriving (Eq, Ord, Show, Enum, Bounded)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Color = Red | Green | Blue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deriving (Eq, Ord, Show, Enum, Bounded)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>deriving</code> 让编译器按标准规则生成实例。现代 GHC 还提供更强的派生策略——<code>DerivingStrategies</code> 让你显式选 <code>stock</code>（内建规则）、<code>newtype</code>（复用底层类型实例）、<code>anyclass</code>（用类的默认方法）、以及 <code>DerivingVia</code>（借另一个类型的实例）。这套机制把大量样板代码消灭在编译期，是 Haskell 工程实践里高频使用的利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型类法则-契约之外的契约\">类型类法则：契约之外的契约</h2><p>标准类型类大多附带「法则」——instance 应当遵守但编译器不强制检查的等式约束。<code>Eq</code> 的 <code>==</code> 应当自反、对称、传递；<code>Ord</code> 应是全序；<code>Monoid</code> 应满足结合律与单位元律。这些法则是抽象可靠复用的前提：库作者基于法则来推理，你若写出违法的实例，代码能编译却会在别处诡异出错。下一篇 <a href=\"functors-applicatives\">Functor 与 Applicative</a> 里，Functor 的两条法则正是这种「法则即契约」思想的关键示范。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型类声明「一组类型需支持哪些操作」，instance 为具体类型认领并实现。</li>\n<li>与 OOP 接口的根本不同：行为与数据分离、可事后为任意类型补实例、编译期字典分派。</li>\n<li>约束 <code>=&gt;</code> 在底层编译成隐式传递的方法字典，这解释了其成本与可解析性要求。</li>\n<li><code>Eq</code>/<code>Ord</code>/<code>Show</code>/<code>Semigroup</code>/<code>Monoid</code> 构成标准网络，<code>Ord</code> 以 <code>Eq</code> 为超类。</li>\n<li><code>deriving</code> 配合 <code>DerivingStrategies</code>/<code>DerivingVia</code> 把样板实例自动化，是工程高频手段。</li>\n<li>类型类法则（如 Monoid 的结合律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋄</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋄</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a\\diamond b)\\diamond c=a\\diamond(b\\diamond c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋄</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）是不被强制但必须遵守的契约，引出 <a href=\"functors-applicatives\">Functor 与 Applicative</a> 的法则讨论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型类","id":"类型类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"声明一个类型类","id":"声明一个类型类"},{"level":2,"text":"约束与字典传递","id":"约束与字典传递"},{"level":2,"text":"常用标准类型类","id":"常用标准类型类"},{"level":2,"text":"自动派生：deriving","id":"自动派生-deriving"},{"level":2,"text":"类型类法则：契约之外的契约","id":"类型类法则-契约之外的契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/foundations/types-basics"},"next":{"title":"Functor 与 Applicative","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/functors-applicatives"}}